OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with some clear
OL,8,Fperiods and variable cloud, cloud
OL,9,Fbecoming more extensive towards
OL,10,Fmorning. A few fog patches developing
OL,11,Facross eastern Aberdeenshire.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with the chance
OL,14,Fof a few showers, these mainly over
OL,15,Fthe hills. Becoming generally drier
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon and evening.
OL,17,FBest of the brightness across the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
